          "code": "GENERATE_POST_ENGAGEMENT_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1768602537884",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768602537887_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are provided with discussion data from a channel, including these input parameters:\n\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.messageContent}} : The actual message posted to the channel\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.messageReactions}} : A mapping of each message to its reactions (such as likes or emojis, which indicate sentiment or agreement)\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.messageReplies}} : An array of replies or threaded responses for each message\nYour task is to review {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.messageReactions}} and {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.messageReplies}} —and focus exclusively on the sentiment and feedback they represent—to generate a concise, professional summary of the overall discussion. \nThe response must be written entirely in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.language}}. Ensure the tone, grammar, and phrasing are natural and appropriate for that language.\nYour summary should:\nCapture the overall mood reflected in reactions and replies (positive, neutral, or negative)\nIdentify key points of consensus, disagreement, or strong sentiment based on reactions and comment tone\nHighlight any notable insights, action items, or follow-up steps if mentioned in replies\nBase all conclusions strictly on the information expressed via reactions and replies, not the message content itself\nPresent your summary in clear, objective language, suitable for a business audience, as plain text with at least 100 characters."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
      "variables": [],
